  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Urgent Action Fund - Africa 2026-2028, CSO-strategin</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Urgent Action Fund - Africa, 2026-2028, CSO-strategy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsens m&#xe5;l best&#xe5;r av ett &#xf6;vergripande impact-m&#xe5;l samt tre outcomes (resultatm&#xe5;l) som uttrycker de huvudsakliga f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar programmet str&#xe4;var efter att bidra till. 

Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let f&#xf6;r insatsen &#xe4;r: An enabling environment for AWHRDs, womens rights organisations (WROs) and their formations to sustain their activism, improve living conditions and to advance womens human rights within their contexts.

Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let ska uppn&#xe5;s genom tre resultatm&#xe5;l som programmet ska rapportera mot:

1.  Increased access to resources for AWHRDs and WROs to rapidly respond and strengthen their institutional capacities to respond to multi-layered crisis, closure of civic space and emerging opportunities as they occur in their contexts. 

2. Increased effectiveness of AWHRDs, WROs and movements to work collectively to advance democracy and counter the push-back against gender equality and women&apos;s rights

3. Strengthened philanthropic advocacy, donor-influencing, generation of new and innovative knowledge to advance civic engagement, human rights and protection of AWHRDs and WROs

Insatsen ska bidra till tv&#xe5; av de globala m&#xe5;len f&#xf6;r h&#xe5;llbar utveckling enligt Agenda 2030: 5. J&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet och 16. Fredliga och inkluderande samh&#xe4;llen.</narrative>
  </description>
